      "message": "is type battery .device_name also the same for the 2S vs. 3S model\nfor that manufacturer? if the manufacturer programmed the same\nmodel number on different battery types, i can see this getting\ndifficult.\n\ni\u0027ve actually had a somewhat opposite problem from this - the brya\nbattery was not recognized because we had a mismatch in the\nconfigured .device_name.",
