      "message": "Hi Caveh,\nYes, even the battery.devicename is also same for 2S \u0026 3S.\nOne possible way would be to intentionally configure the manufacturer name(board_battery_info[x].fuel_gauge.manuf_name )  as Getac_3s \u0026 Getac_2S instead of Getac so that , we hit the condition where type \u003d BATTERY_TYPE_COUNT , so that board_get_default_battery_type() can get cald. But , problem in this forceful fake name case is that , the 1st call to identify battery (init_battery_type() ) will fail and we will get the result that battery not found, which is not right.",
